              "texto": "Same pattern: [[5811|-ar verbs with e > ie]]."
            },
            {
              "forma": "quiero",
              "texto": "Same change in an -er verb: [[5774|querer]]."
            },
            {
              "forma": "pienso ir",
              "texto": "Pensar + infinitive, _to plan to_: [[8860|pensar + infinitive]]."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
